  "caveats": [
    "MARGINAL, not incremental: firing rate is matched, the other predictors are NOT. Pairwise block correlations reach 0.85, so a strong value may be a correlated neighbour showing through.",
    "No confidence intervals. Differences under ~0.02 should not be read; rare indicators (n_pos < ~1,500) are the noisiest rows.",
    "Both firing-rate senses are matched, but the rest of the activity family is not: mean_act_cond correlates only 0.40 with activity and is NOT well matched by this design.",
    "dense_latent_flag concentrates in the top firing deciles, so its matched value rests on comparatively few within-bin pairs.",
    "functional_role and gurnee_promoting_class were EXCLUDED from the 24-block Shapley decomposition (kappa = 0.310 for functional_role; gurnee is a q0.90 slice off footprint_kurt/skew). functional_role levels appear here for completeness and should not carry a headline.",
    "Population is the v2 (proj_var-corrected) covariate universe, complete-case over the 19 continuous cluster representatives."
  ]
